{
	"version": 5,
	"id": "Bq7zsp-EBrvcul5hb",
	"notes": "An Electro-Priest: a fanatical warrior-priest of the Motive Force who chose this transformation to serve the Cult Mechanicus body and soul (Codex: Adeptus Mechanicus background) -- devoted, doctrinally certain, and dangerous in a fight, not the near-mindless temple slave a Servitor is (Adeptus Mechanicus/Templates/Combat Servitor.gct is that template instead). Baseline below is the Corpuscarii pattern (ranged electrostatic gauntlets); enable the disabled \"Lens: Fulgurite Conversion\" for the melee electroleech-staff pattern instead. Point math: ST 12 (+20), DX 11 (+20), IQ 10 (+0), HT 12 (+20) = 60, plus Will +2 (+10) = 70; advantages +124 (Electoo Inductors 1 + Voltagheist Field 49 + Electrostatic Gauntlets, Corpuscarii Pattern 53 + Respirator Plugs 5 + Potentia Coil 2 + High Pain Threshold 10 + Fearlessness x2 4); disadvantages -40; skills +28. Total 182 points, just above framework.md's \"Trained soldier (100-175)\" tier and just under \"Elite human (200-350)\" -- a devoted zealot-warrior, tougher and better-defended than a Guardsman but not as broadly trained as a Battle Sister or Inquisitorial acolyte. The electro-flail/staff itself (the physical weapon a Fulgurite carries) and any other equipment are not covered here; the attack traits below are the augmetic/bio-electric ability, not a separate weapon purchase.\n",
	"traits": [
		{
			"id": "tXWkazPIWktyEnW3G",
			"name": "ST",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The augmentation process and the physical rigors of temple service both select for real strength.\n\nDesign: ST 12 (+2), 10 pts/level (B15).",
			"tags": [
				"Attribute"
			],
			"base_points": 20,
			"features": [
				{
					"type": "attribute_bonus",
					"attribute": "st",
					"amount": 2
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": "tmw7zO36TTjy0TGdr",
			"name": "DX",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Enough reflex to fight in melee or land a gauntlet-arc on a moving target.\n\nDesign: DX 11 (+1), 20 pts/level (B15).",
			"tags": [
				"Attribute"
			],
			"base_points": 20,
			"features": [
				{
					"type": "attribute_bonus",
