			"name": "Innate Attack",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The skill that resolves an Electrostatic Gauntlets shot (B61); a Fulgurite build should move these points to Staff instead (see the Fulgurite lens above).\n\nDesign: DX+3 (14) for 8 points, Easy (B170).",
			"tags": [
