			"id": "s6roFpvUgWFcHn93w",
			"name": "Brawling",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Unarmed and improvised fighting.\n\nDesign: DX+0 (11) for 1 point, Easy.",
			"tags": [
				"Imperium"
			],
			"difficulty": "dx/e",
			"points": 1
		},
		{
			"id": "sBlyM3qs2xgBRSu_n",
			"name": "Climbing",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Basic temple-guard fitness.\n\nDesign: DX-1 (10) for 1 point, Average.",
			"tags": [
				"Imperium"
			],
			"difficulty": "dx/a",
			"points": 1
		},
		{
			"id": "syjeTzFLvDI867ZIo",
			"name": "Running",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Basic conditioning.\n\nDesign: HT-1 (11) for 1 point, Average.",
			"tags": [
				"Imperium"
			],
			"difficulty": "ht/a",
			"points": 1
		},
		{
			"id": "sxgFCohxs-MCArGZJ",
			"name": "Meditation",
			"reference": "B207",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The trance-discipline that keeps a permanently electrified body and an equally charged faith both under control.\n\nDesign: Will-1 for 2 points, Hard; Meditation is Will-based (B207).",
			"tags": [
				"Imperium"
			],
			"difficulty": "will/h",
			"points": 2
		},
		{
			"id": "sNrySgWpHjUiL30JE",
			"name": "Staff",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The electroleech staff's weapon skill, per framework.md's weapon-skill table (Staff covers polearm-length two-handed staves). Bought at 0 points in the Corpuscarii baseline; a Fulgurite build moves the 8 points off Innate Attack (Beam) above onto this skill, raised to 12 points (DX+3, 14, Average), leaving the Fulgurite total at the baseline figure.\n\nDesign: Listed here so a Fulgurite conversion has an obvious line to raise; contributes 0 points to this template's baseline total.",
			"tags": [
				"Imperium",
